# Gamification

- XP is an append-only `xp_transactions` ledger. Never `profiles.xp = user_input`.
- All grants go through `apply_xp` (or equivalent) after eligibility checks. No public “give XP” API.
- Rules live in `xp_rules` / missions; client only displays them.
- Leaderboards are views/snapshots of trusted balances, not uploaded ranks.
- Tests required: idempotency, caps, settlement, negative admin adjust.

# Match presence

- Client may send a location sample; server decides verified/rejected.
- One verified presence per `(user_id, fixture_id)`.
- No continuous tracking; geofence only inside the match window if used at all.
- Do not store precise GPS longer than the KVKK retention policy.

See `docs/GAMIFICATION.md` and `docs/MATCH-PRESENCE.md`.
